  ],
  "scope": "Construct four actual assigned fibers for two exceptional matching pairs, a finite partner code preserving both pair identities and both core assignments, and a linear disjoint reserve of actual compressed boundaries for every exceptional set of size at most five. Transport actual pair copies into reserve-avoiding residuals. Construct four-label joining palettes from the completed circuit decomposition, with protected-primary grouping, and simultaneously complete two internal pair pools relative to one original joining palette, allowing both prescribed copies to share a protected color. Native assembly preserves exact whole boundaries under its explicit joining-trace and pair-support hypotheses. Extend terminal factorization to two separately closed pair components using the original edge copies. The native safe residual, protected traces and degree budgets, two-pair-plus-one-star assembly, and the zero-/one-pair multi-star branches remain unfinished. All 69 pinned numbered records, including their 51 complete statuses, remain unchanged; the main theorem is unverified.",
